{
 "$comment": "Geometric validation properties embedded by the originating CAD systems in the official NIST MBE PMI STEP files, plus an entity census (records instantiating each PMI / tessellation / B-rep / assembly type, simple or complex). Extracted with extract_validation_properties.py (stdlib, independent of OCC). A llull importer must recompute GVP from the imported B-rep and compare (VC-XCH-05/06), and its semantic PMI import must account for every census item (VC-XCH-07). lengthUnitDetected = the length unit of the representation context that holds the geometry / validation properties (GLOBAL_UNIT_ASSIGNED_CONTEXT), converted-unit factor times its own unit; entries listing lengthUnitCorrection were first extracted as the first LENGTH_UNIT record of the file, which was wrong for files that declare several units. GVP entries whose values are all 0 (placeholders, e.g. STC 06) are dropped and counted in placeholderGvpDropped.",
